  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/009', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/010', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/011', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/012', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/013', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/014', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Termika is not in the register table. The older file called it a canal dock, which the manuscript does not support. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/015', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/016', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Whether the Palace is the source of the loudspeaker in Interlude VI should be checked. Checked: Interlude I calls the transcript the Palace loudspeaker, and Interlude IV places the studio in the Palace. Interlude VI uses the same words from a fitting in a hall on the left bank and does not name the source. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/017', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/018', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/019', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. The older files list these as Gestapo HQ and Pawiak Prison, and they are merged here. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/020', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/021', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/022', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/023', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/024', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Written from the project''s screening points file. Section 6.4 of Protocol 002 should be checked against it. Checked: section 6.4 agrees with this entry. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/025', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/026', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Written from the project''s screening points file. Needs checking against Interlude VI. Checked against Interlude VI: the sports hall, the left bank and the date of 14 June 2035 agree, the date being the ledger''s. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/027', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. The older file The Land Beyond is not found in the manuscript and is held as reference only. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/028', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Whose testimony carries each account should be confirmed. Confirmed: the 1944 account is Marek''s story, recorded in Diana''s diary, and the three weeks are Nikita''s own account. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/029', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Alex says that Fritha''s church is listed in Class D under the name of a place that was a cathedral. This may be that building, but the manuscript does not say so. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/030', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. The older files list the Wetlands and the Docks as separate places. The Docks are covered under Termika. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/LOC/031', 'Codex Doc status: Draft. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/001', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Decide: the manuscript records her as disappeared, not dead; the entry follows it. The fiancé detail has been checked: the manuscript names him once and gives no date. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/002', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. The older profile describes him as commander of field operations; the manuscript passages read show him as guide and watcher. Decide: kept to the manuscript. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/003', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Decide: the church is linked to LOC/029 (St Michael''s Cathedral) and Diana''s diary of 9 August 2034 names St Michael''s Cathedral on the Praga side, which confirms it. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/004', 'Codex Doc status: Filed in short form. Decide: the older profile gives details not found in the manuscript passages read; they are left out until confirmed. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/005', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. The control room is at OP-Termika, the Docks (Diana''s diary of 26 July 2034), and the Termika entry is now referenced. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/006', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. The room is in a former school in Wrocław (Chapter 7). The meaning of the bow is given in her own account in the same chapter. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/007', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Her relationship with Pawel is confirmed in Chapter 8, and Mrs Lewandowska lived. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/008', 'Codex Doc status: Short entry. Chapter 10 has now been read for this entry. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/009', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. The older profile gives her age as 17 only and describes her as male in one place. The manuscript gives both ages and a female captain. Decide: the manuscript is followed. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/010', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Decide: the manuscript gives two ages because the accounts were taken at different times; both are kept. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/011', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Her part in the sewers is confirmed in Nikita''s account in Chapter 14: she led Nikita there and they stayed three weeks. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/012', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Decide: surname spelled as in the manuscript (Chapter 14 header) and the project brief. The feminine form Sokołowska would be usual in Polish; flagged for the author. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/013', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. Decide: age kept as "about 12" to match the manuscript. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
  ('SYNPTCL/CHR/014', 'Codex Doc status: Filed. No surname given in the passages read. Expanded and checked against the manuscript, 8 November 2026. Awaiting David''s review.'),
